{
  "_comment": [
    "Per-developer LOCAL overrides for the auth-api host run (dotnet run, Development).",
    "Copy this file to 'appsettings.Local.json' (git-ignored). It is also the file the EF design-time factories read.",
    "On every host start DatabaseSeederExtensions.SeedAuthDatabaseAsync reads AdminUser:* and idempotently",
    "seeds a confirmed admin in the Admin role — so the login survives 'docker compose down -v' (just restart auth-api).",
    "Leave Email or Password blank to skip admin seeding. Password must satisfy the Identity policy:",
    "min 8 chars + uppercase + lowercase + digit + non-alphanumeric (PersistenceDependencyInjection.cs)."
  ],
  "AdminUser": {
    "Username": "admin",
    "Email": "admin@lotro.local",
    "Password": "ChangeMe!2345"
  }
}
